      <li><strong>Calculate Impressions Mode:</strong> Enter your available budget and CPM rate to project the total impressions your campaign will generate.</li>
      <li><strong>Itemized Cost Per Impression Table:</strong> Automatically displays your cost for 1, 100, 1,000, 10,000, and 100,000 ad impressions.</li>
    </ul>

